        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, liquefied, at freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, at freight ship
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas.\nTechnology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.\nTime period: Transport modes investigated for 2019.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Erdgas\nLocal subcategory: Bereitstellung\nSource file: EcoSpold-oil¬gas-transport-2020-v2.0-LNG-RU.xml\n\n
This dataset describes the transport of natural gas on a freight ship between the liquefaction plant in Russian Federation and the evaporation plant in Europe.
Location: none
Technology: The distances between liquefaction and evaporation plant is based on port distances.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2019.
Production volume: none
Sampling: Literature. Online calculators for distances.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_744ee3c3-2faa-3406-9042-b33606458601.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
